{"channelId":"UCG2CL6EUjG8TVT1Tpl9nJdg","row":["Ms Rachel - Toddler Learning Videos",21300000,"Toddler Learning Videos and Baby Learning Videos with a real teacher, Ms Rachel! Ms Rachel uses techniques recommended by speech therapists and early childhood experts to help children learn important milestones and preschool skills! You can trust Ms Rachel to provide interactive, high quality screen time!\n\nMs Rachel also gets kids moving through fun nursery rhymes & kids songs videos! Her videos for toddlers are informed by research and are full of learning standards that will help preschoolers thrive! Ms Rachel loves teaching letters, numbers, colors, animal sounds and more! She also has learn to talk videos and incorporates sign language!\n\nMs Rachel has a masters in music education from NYU and is almost finished a second masters in early childhood education. Parents and children can watch and learn together. Ms Rachel loves to teach and loves your wonderful family! Let's learn, grow and thrive!","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCG2CL6EUjG8TVT1Tpl9nJdg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCG2CL6EUjG8TVT1Tpl9nJdg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:50.090Z","channelId":"UCG2CL6EUjG8TVT1Tpl9nJdg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"6f88f21702036f5aead315a07829da43ff30f9b7186761c8880357ec92a0b970","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"c565d55a18279249af8a3dcdf0b9c2d4273a5920eb559e7b9ddef8935ce6f932"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCG2CL6EUjG8TVT1Tpl9nJdg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:50.090Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCG2CL6EUjG8TVT1Tpl9nJdg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":21300000,"raw":"21.3M subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCG2CL6EUjG8TVT1Tpl9nJdg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:19:50.090Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"re